{"id":"e5debbac37901ffe","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-prop-stationary.md","title":"Stationary Properties","display":"prop-stationary — Stationary Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-stationary","aliases":["58-prop-stationary"],"display":"prop-stationary — Stationary Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-stationary]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[../batch20/58-df-club]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-stationary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-stationary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-stationary — Stationary Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary\">../batch19/58-df-stationary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club\">../batch20/58-df-club</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> (candidate stationary set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationarity predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}\\)</span> (club predicate from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}stationary}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}stationary}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A set is stationary exactly when it meets every club subset of the regular uncountable ambient cardinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}stationary}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1072,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3995","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-prop-stationary.md|58-prop-stationary]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["b802c3dd76418d95","0fbfc19800246e77","04670bdc8b64b8dd"]}